> 2. Is it worth entering Sokoban and reverse-genociding nurses?  ie -
> do mid-game wizards have hitpoint issues?

If your going to reverse genocide, I think foocubi make more sense for
a wizard.  First, a wizard, unlike most classes, can really use extra
levels because they help with spells.  Foocubi can give you extra
power and wisdom as well as extra hit points.  Of course, that depends
upon your being tough enough to shrug off their attacks. I'm betting
you are close to that point, but not quite there yet.

